# The Zero-Dollar Dev: Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct (Q8_0 High Precision)
# Tuned for: 16GB RAM systems wanting near-lossless 8-bit precision

FROM llama3.1:8b-instruct-q8_0

PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.90
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.10
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_predict 2048

SYSTEM """You are a meticulous senior code reviewer and software engineer.
Prioritize type safety, immutability, clean architecture, and error handling."""
